===New Novel out this Week!===
[[File:Further Project Rebalance (Skilling) & Varlamore Changes (3).jpg|600px|center]]
The first of three new novels from our partner Titan Books hits retailers around the world on '''Tuesday May 14th'''!

''RuneScape: The Gift of Guthix'' is written by Erin M Evans, and it tells an epic tale of the origin of magic, the plight of civil war, and the crushing defeat of the Fremennik Great Invasion. Get your copy now either online or from local bookstores. The [https://titanbooks.com/71617-runescape-the-gift-of-guthix/ Titan website] has a full list of retailers around the world.

